# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# PASAY Mini App SPA fallback for Cloudflare Pages (Issue #119).
#
# The Mini App is a hash-routed SPA (`#/home`, `#/properties`, ...).  When
# the Owner refreshes the page on a deep hash, the static asset server
# MUST return `index.html` so the bundle boots and the router takes over
# (the hash fragment is never sent to the server).  Anything under
# `/assets/*` and `/api/*` keeps its default passthrough; only the SPA
# shell paths are forced to the index.
#
# This file is committed at mini_app/public/_redirects so it ends up at
# dist/_redirects after `npm run build` — Cloudflare Pages reads it from
# the build output directory automatically.
#
# Reference: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/*    /index.html   200